Jinn

== mac-cua (Apache License 2.0) ==
https://github.com/hyprcat/mac-cua
Jinn's macOS "hands" layer follows mac-cua's design. These Swift files are ports of mac-cua Python modules:
  app/Sources/Jinn/Hands/Prune.swift      (app/_lib/pruning.py)
  app/Sources/Jinn/Hands/Snapshot.swift   (refetch logic from app/_lib/refetchable_tree.py)
  app/Sources/Jinn/Hands/Keys.swift       (app/_lib/keys.py, full key map)
  app/Sources/Jinn/Hands/Input.swift      (delivery rules from app/_lib/input.py)
  app/Sources/Jinn/Hands/Click.swift      (click strategy from app/session.py)
  app/Sources/Jinn/Hands/Accessibility.swift (AX error table from app/_lib/errors.py)
  app/Sources/Jinn/Hands/Interrupt.swift  (UserInteractionMonitor in app/_lib/focus.py)
  app/Sources/Jinn/Core/Safety.swift      (app blocklist from app/_lib/safety.py)
